{"name": "Pain-to-Solution 15-20s Feature Spotlight", "description": "Start with hyper-specific pain/frustration visual or text hook, quick demo of one time-saving feature via animated UI or screen record, end with clear CTA. Use captions and dynamic visuals.", "hypothesis": "if we apply this, CTR improves because it mirrors audience daily challenges (high relevance for dev/SaaS buyers) and proves value fast in short format preferred for X in-feed, outperforming feature dumps or long intros", "implementation_hint": "Limit to one feature; before/after or input-output sequence; early brand; pair with tweet hook like 'world's first ___' or specific metric claim", "source": "https://fluxnote.io/guides/saas-video-ads-for-twitter-x or https://www.saashero.net/content/visual-saas-b2b-ad-examples/"},
